5T22:57:10Z"},"body":"The `OpenXRCompositionLayer*` nodes are meant to have a fallback mesh when OpenXR doesn't support the given composition layer type\r\n\r\nHowever, we should also create the fallback mesh when OpenXR isn't being used at all - otherwise, there's just nothing rendered!\r\n\r\nIn fact, this already seemed to work if you happened to have `enable_hole_punch` set to `true` (which is very commonly used); but if you didn't, there was nothing to trigger its creation\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes that by having it check on `NOTIFICATION_READY` if the fallback should be created, and create it if needed. If OpenXR is later started (which really shouldn't happen, given how early OpenXR is meant to start, but just in case!) then it'll update the fallback mesh","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123522/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123522/timeline","performed_via_github_a